        "BookOfEternityClient/Services/CharacteristicsService.cs:210",
        "BookOfEternityClient/Services/CharacteristicsService.cs:233"
      ],
      "consequence": "Base-stat change precedes command clearing; point increment precedes processed-level marker; interactive distribution changes base/point balance separately. Existing processed-level field is useful durable state but is not an atomic bound joint receipt."
    },
    {
      "id": "QTE_JOINT_HANDOFF_NOT_AUTHORIZED",
      "classification": "confirmed API/ownership incompatibility",
      "evidence": [
