        "BookOfEternityClient/Services/QteSceneService.cs:746",
        "BookOfEternityClient/Core/GameEngine/GameEngine.MortalJointStoryTurn.cs:98"
      ],
      "consequence": "Existing QTE atomic acceptance is reusable machinery, but its proof accepts only real console/browser story provenance; joint row cannot be relabeled. Any retained prior continuation occupies the same root. Joint cleanup currently removes original/Ready/backups before ordinary QTE handoff would need them."
    }
